### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### digiField360.ai — Real-Time Salesforce Login API Test
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### Instructions:
### 1. Install "REST Client" extension (Ctrl+Shift+X -> search "REST Client" -> Install).
### 2. Click the small "Send Request" button that appears above the POST line below.
### 3. The live Salesforce response will open on the right side!

### 1. VALID LOGIN (Real Salesforce Credentials -> Returns 200 OK + Real 00D Token)
POST https://digifields-360.onrender.com/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "piyush.channe.3868c7575da5@agentforce.com",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2. WRONG PASSWORD TEST (Returns 401 Unauthorized Rejection)
POST https://digifields-360.onrender.com/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "piyush.channe.3868c7575da5@agentforce.com",
  "password": "WRONG_PASSWORD_123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3. UNKNOWN USER TEST (Returns 401 Unauthorized Rejection)
POST https://digifields-360.onrender.com/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "unknown.user@example.com",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD_HERE"
}
